astral-launcher.patch and assets/launcher provenance

The launcher, input remapping, layout, drawing code and tests are original work. The patch carries context from the
pinned public runtime (SuperMarioWonderRecomp at 010ed7a596a621c15d3a8dfa5795ca8c3668b066).

Third-party code added by the patch, unmodified:

  runtime/src/third_party/stb_truetype.h  stb_truetype v1.26, Sean Barrett, https://github.com/nothings/stb
  runtime/src/third_party/stb_image.h     stb_image v2.30, Sean Barrett and contributors, same repository

  Both are dual-licensed by their authors: public domain (unlicense.org) or the MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett; the full text is at the end of each header. They are used here
  under the public domain alternative.

Assets (assets/launcher, outside the patch; the runtime loads them at run time):

  Baloo2-Bold.ttf  Baloo 2, Copyright 2019 The Baloo 2 Project Authors (https://github.com/EkType/Baloo2),
                   SIL Open Font License 1.1 (assets/launcher/OFL.txt). Made from google/fonts
                   ofl/baloo2/Baloo2[wght].ttf: instanced at wght=700 and subset to Latin (U+0020-007E,
                   U+00A0-00FF and a few punctuation marks) with fontTools. No Reserved Font Name is declared.
  title-bg.jpg     Original AI-generated artwork made for this project (no game assets, characters or logos),
                   resized to 1600x900 and JPEG-compressed.

No game material is included.
